graph TD
    %% Carbon Source Input
    A[Glucose in Medium] --> B[PTS Transport System]
    C[Lactose in Medium] --> D[Lactose Signal]
    E[Arabinose in Medium] --> F[Arabinose Signal]
    
    %% Decision: Glucose Present?
    B --> G{Glucose Present?}
    
    %% High Glucose Path - Catabolite Repression
    G -->|Yes| H[PEP-Dependent Glucose Transport]
    H --> I[EIIAGlc Dephosphorylation]
    I --> J[EIIAGlc-P Depletion]
    J --> K[/Adenylyl Cyclase Inhibition/]
    K --> L[Low cAMP Synthesis]
    L --> M[Low cAMP Levels]
    
    %% Decision: cAMP Levels
    M --> N{High cAMP?}
    
    %% Low cAMP - Repression Active
    N -->|No| O[CRP Inactive Apo-form]
    O --> P[No CRP-DNA Binding]
    P --> Q[\lac Operon Repressed/]
    P --> R[\ara Operon Repressed/]
    P --> S[\mal Operons Repressed/]
    Q --> T[No Lactose Utilization]
    R --> U[No Arabinose Utilization]
    S --> V[No Maltose Utilization]
    T --> W[Glucose-Only Metabolism]
    U --> W
    V --> W
    W --> X[Rapid Growth on Glucose]
    
    %% Low Glucose Path - Derepression
    G -->|No| Y[No PTS Activity]
    Y --> Z[EIIAGlc Phosphorylation]
    Z --> AA[EIIAGlc-P Accumulation]
    AA --> AB[Adenylyl Cyclase Activation]
    AB --> AC[cAMP Synthesis]
    AC --> AD[High cAMP Levels]
    
    %% cAMP-CRP Complex Formation
    AD --> N
    N -->|Yes| AE[cAMP Binds CRP]
    AE --> AF[CRP Conformational Change]
    AF --> AG[CRP-cAMP Active Complex]
    
    %% AND Gate 1: lac Operon Activation
    AG --> ANDGATE1{CRP-cAMP AND<br/>lac Promoter Available?}
    D --> AH[Lactose Inducer Signal]
    AH --> ANDGATE1
    ANDGATE1 -->|Yes| AI[CRP-cAMP Binds lac Promoter]
    AI --> AJ[lac Operon Transcription]
    AJ --> AK[lac Genes Expressed]
    AK --> AL[Lactose Utilization]
    
    %% AND Gate 2: ara Operon Activation
    AG --> ANDGATE2{CRP-cAMP AND<br/>ara Promoter Available?}
    F --> AM[Arabinose Inducer Signal]
    AM --> ANDGATE2
    ANDGATE2 -->|Yes| AN[CRP-cAMP Binds ara Promoter]
    AN --> AO[ara Operon Transcription]
    AO --> AP[ara Genes Expressed]
    AP --> AQ[/Arabinose Utilization/]
    
    %% mal Operons
    AG --> AR[/CRP-cAMP Binds mal Promoters/]
    AR --> AS[/mal Operons Transcription/]
    AS --> AT[mal Genes Expressed]
    AT --> AU[Maltose Utilization]
    
    %% Alternative Sugar Metabolism
    AL --> AV[Alternative Carbon Source Use]
    AQ --> AV
    AU --> AV
    AV --> AW[Slower Growth]
    AW --> AX[Metabolic Adaptation]
    
    %% System Outputs
    X --> AY[Optimal Glucose Growth]
    AX --> AZ[Survival on Other Sugars]
    
